sec.p:
We explored two methods of anchoring the DCE data onto the cTTO data: (1) linear mapping and (2) non-linear mapping. The mapping employed a regression model to model the relationship between the predicted DCE values and the mean observed cTTO values for each health state included in the cTTO design. Two different mapping models were applied: a linear mapping strategy that took the form of Eq. 1, and a power model taking the form of Eq. 2.1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
